      "source": "Base class for <a href=\"MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a> implementations. Sets up a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/GenericConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>GenericConversionService</code></a> and populates basic\nconverters. Allows registering <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "MongoConverter 实现的基础类。配置 <a href=\"MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>，设置一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/GenericConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>GenericConversionService</code></a> 并填充基本转换器。允许注册 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityConverter.html#getConversionService()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\">getConversionService</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\">EntityConverter</a>&lt;<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\">MongoPersistentEntity</a>&lt;?&gt;, <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\">MongoPersistentProperty</a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>, org.bson.conversions.Bson&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityConverter.html#getConversionService()\" title=\"类或接口位于 org.springframework.data.convert\">getConversionService</a></code> 在接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityConverter.html\" title=\"类或接口位于 org.springframework.data.convert\">EntityConverter</a>&lt;<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"接口位于 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\">MongoPersistentEntity</a>&lt;?&gt;, <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"接口位于 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\">MongoPersistentProperty</a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"类或接口位于 java.lang\">Object</a>, org.bson.conversions.Bson&gt;</code> 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">afterPropertiesSet</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">InitializingBean</a></code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\" title=\"类或接口，位于 org.springframework.beans.factory\">afterPropertiesSet</a></code> 是接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"类或接口，位于 org.springframework.beans.factory\">InitializingBean</a></code> 中的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>conversionService</code> - can be null and defaults to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/DefaultConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>DefaultConversionService</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>conversionService</code> - 可为 null，默认值为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/DefaultConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>DefaultConversionService</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>instantiators</code> - can be null. Uses default <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/EntityInstantiators.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>EntityInstantiators</code></a> if so.",
      "translation": "<code>instantiators</code> - 可为 null。若为 null，则使用默认的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/EntityInstantiators.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>EntityInstantiators</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
